 hly ceremony of recognizing and renewing our aspiration to embody the <a hr
 ef="https://sanshin-source.weebly.com/precepts.html" target="_blank"><u>bod
 hisattva precepts</u></a> throughout our lives.<br><br>​All are welcome\, i
 n-person and <a href="https://www.sanshinji.org/virtual-practice.html" targ
 et="_blank"><u>virtually</u></a>\, whether or not you've formally received 
 precepts. <br></td></tr></tbody></table><br><strong><em>If attending in per
 son\, please show up by 6:50 pm\, to allow enough time for offering incense
  and purifying rakusu or okesa (if you have one) before the ceremony.</em><
 /strong>
